    Title "Booking"
    __dynamicVariables
    Description "Book a 2 hour appointment at {{contact.address}} with the contact {{contact.name}} "
    Prompt "Share soonest available times. Consultations take up to 2 hours and are in-home with the designer. In a polite manner let customer know we ask for all home owners to be present during consult. When a contact responds with “Yes” or “OK” to a slot offer, the bot should book them immediately."
